  "system": {
    "identifier": "sleep-of-the-deep",
    "description": "<p>Your chakra creeps into the dreams of others, haunting and terrifying them. Choose any number of sleeping creatures that you are aware of within range. Creatures that do not need to sleep, cannot be targeted.</p>\n<p>The creature must make a wisdom saving throw. On a failed save it garners no benefits from any form of rest for the duration and when it awakens from any rest it may take, it gains 1 rank of Exhaustion and Demoralized for as long as it has any ranks of Exhaustion granted by this jutsu.</p>",
